{"id":71204,"date":"2026-10-28T09:39:09","date_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:39:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71204"},"modified":"2026-10-28T10:44:14","modified_gmt":"2026-10-28T09:44:14","slug":"trilhos-dos-reis","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-dos-reis\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos dos Reis 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos dos Reis 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trilhos dos Reis 2027<\/strong> (13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realizam-se nos dias <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">16 e 17 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Portalegre<\/strong> e nas vertentes do Parque Natural da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">DAP \u2013 Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Desporto e Aventura de Portalegre<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica de abertura do calend\u00e1rio nacional de trail running re\u00fane at\u00e9 2000 participantes ao longo de dois dias de competi\u00e7\u00e3o e conv\u00edvio no Alto Alentejo. Planeia os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e descobre mais eventos no guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none;\">Provas de Trail em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa arranca no s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">16 de janeiro<\/strong>, com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Corrida dos Pr\u00edncipes \u2013 Kids Night Run<\/strong> (partidas \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">18:15<\/strong> para Infantis\/Iniciados e \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">19:00<\/strong> para Traquinas\/Benjamins, com frontal obrigat\u00f3rio). No domingo, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">17 de janeiro<\/strong>, a partir da Arena dos Reis (junto ao Mercado Municipal de Portalegre), partem as cinco provas principais: <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Ultra Trilhos dos Reis de 48 km<\/strong> (2700 m D+, partida \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">08:00<\/strong>), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trilhos dos Reis de 32 km<\/strong> (1600 m D+, \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">08:45<\/strong>), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Trilhos dos Reis Sprint de 20 km<\/strong> (850 m D+, \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">09:30<\/strong>), <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini Trilhos dos Reis de 17 km<\/strong> (750 m D+, \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>) e <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada dos Reis de 14 km<\/strong> (\u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10:00<\/strong>), alcan\u00e7ando os 975 metros de altitude m\u00e1xima na Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com secretariado instalado no <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mercado Municipal de Portalegre<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado das 15:00 \u00e0s 20:00 e domingo a partir das 06:30), a prova disponibiliza abastecimentos a cada 7 a 8 km, dormida gratuita em solo duro no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Portalegre, banhos quentes, op\u00e7\u00e3o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o com ou sem almo\u00e7o e pr\u00e9mios aos primeiros classificados da geral e escal\u00f5es.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">16 a 17 de Janeiro de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-te