ce-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida dos Pr\u00edncipes \u2013 Kids Night Run<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 16 Jan \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:15<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica (at\u00e9 31\/12):<\/strong> 9,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (limite 200 vagas)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realizam os Trilhos dos Reis 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A 13\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o dos Trilhos dos Reis realiza-se no fim de semana de 16 e 17 de janeiro de 2027, em Portalegre, com secretariado no Mercado Municipal de Portalegre e partidas na Arena dos Reis rumo \u00e0 Serra de S\u00e3o Mamede.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias, desn\u00edveis e hor\u00e1rios de partida?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado (16 de janeiro) realiza-se a Kids Night Run (Infantis\/Iniciados \u00e0s 18:15 e Traquinas\/Benjamins \u00e0s 19:00). No domingo (17 de janeiro) partem o Ultra Trilhos dos Reis 48 km (2700 m D+, \u00e0s 08:00), Trilhos dos Reis 32 km (1600 m D+, \u00e0s 08:45), Trilhos dos Reis Sprint 20 km (850 m D+, \u00e0s 09:30), Mini Trilhos dos Reis 17 km (750 m D+, \u00e0s 10:00) e Caminhada dos Reis 14 km (\u00e0s 10:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que diferencia os packs?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem de 1 de outubro a 31 de dezembro de 2026 com op\u00e7\u00e3o sem almo\u00e7o ou com almo\u00e7o: Ultra 48 km (35,00 \u20ac \/ 43,00 \u20ac), Trail 32 km (30,00 \u20ac \/ 38,00 \u20ac), Sprint 20 km (20,00 \u20ac \/ 28,00 \u20ac), Mini Trail 17 km (17,00 \u20ac \/ 25,00 \u20ac), Caminhada 14 km (14,00 \u20ac \/ 22,00 \u20ac) e Kids Night Run (9,00 \u20ac).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando funciona o secretariado e h\u00e1 alojamento em solo duro?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Mercado Municipal de Portalegre no s\u00e1bado, 16 de janeiro, das 15:00 \u00e0s 20:00, e no domingo, 17 de janeiro, a partir das 06:30. A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza dormida em solo duro no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal de Portalegre e banhos quentes no final da prova.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e o material obrigat\u00f3rio exigido aos atletas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite global do Ultra Trail (48 km) \u00e9 de 9 horas (encerramento \u00e0s 18:00). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio o transporte de manta t\u00e9rmica, telem\u00f3vel operacional, apito, reservat\u00f3rio de l\u00edquidos com capacidade m\u00ednima de 1 litro e copo pr\u00f3prio (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos descart\u00e1veis nos abastecimentos). Na Kids Night Run \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio o uso de luz frontal.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trilhos dos Reis 2027\", \"startDate\":